meta {
  name: List Locales
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.LocaleService/ListLocales
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Accept-Language: en
}

body:json {
  {
    "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "perPage": 20
    }
  }
}

docs {
  # List Locales

  Retrieves a paginated list of all locales in the system.

  ## Request
  - `pagination.page` (optional): Page number, defaults to 1
  - `pagination.perPage` (optional): Items per page, defaults to 20, max 100

  ## Response
  Returns an array of locales with pagination metadata.

  ## Headers
  - `Accept-Language` (optional): Preferred locale for the `name` field (e.g., "en", "de", "ja")
    Defaults to "en" if not provided.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "locales": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "code": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "names": {
          "en": "English",
          "de": "Englisch",
          "fr": "Anglais",
          "es": "Inglés",
          "it": "Inglese",
          "pt": "Inglês",
          "ja": "英語",
          "zh": "英语"
        },
        "isDefault": true,
        "createdAt": "2026-03-27T18:12:31+01:00",
        "updatedAt": "2026-03-27T18:12:31+01:00"
      }
    ],
    "pagination": {
      "total": 8,
      "page": 1,
      "perPage": 20,
      "totalPages": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  **Note**: The `name` field returns the localized name based on `Accept-Language` header.
  The `names` object contains all available translations.
}
